<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Online Vehicle Service and Fuel Station Management System</title>
    
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-image: url('assets/images/Home_Background.jpg'); /* Background image */
            background-size: cover; /* Cover the entire page */
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); /* Slightly transparent background for container */
            padding: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0px 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex; /* Use flexbox for even spacing */
            flex-direction: column; /* Align items in a column */
            justify-content: space-between; /* Evenly spread the content */
            height: 100%; /* Full height for proper spacing */
        }
        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 20px; /* Space below the heading */
        }
        h2 {
            color: black; /* Changed to black for the FAQ heading */
        }
        .faq {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background-color: #ADD8E6; /* Light blue background for FAQs */
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .faq h3 {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: #333; /* Dark text for FAQ questions */
        }
        .faq p {
            font-size: 1em;
            color: #666; /* Gray color for FAQ paragraphs */
        }
        .contact {
            margin-top: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #333; /* Grey color for contact section */
            color: white; /* Change contact text color to white */
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .contact h2 {
            font-size: 1.8em;
            color: white; /* Changed "Contact Us" to white */
        }
        .contact p {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: white; /* Ensure paragraph text is also white */
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Help Page</h1> <!-- Help page heading only -->

        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions : </h2>
        
        <div class="faq">
            <h3>1. How do I book a vehicle service?</h3>
            <p>You can book a service by logging into your account, selecting your vehicle, and choosing a time slot that is convenient for you. You'll receive a confirmation email after booking.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq">
            <h3>2. Can I cancel or reschedule a service booking?</h3>
            <p>Yes, you can cancel or reschedule a service appointment up to 24 hours before the appointment time by visiting the 'My Bookings' section in your account.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq">
            <h3>3. How do I check fuel prices?</h3>
            <p>Fuel prices are updated in real-time on our website. Simply visit the 'Fuel Prices' section from the main menu.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq">
            <h3>4. What payment methods are accepted?</h3>
            <p>We accept payments via credit/debit cards, mobile payments, and cash on delivery (for certain services).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq">
            <h3>5. What should I do in case of emergency vehicle breakdown?</h3>
            <p>If your vehicle breaks down, you can call our emergency roadside assistance team, available 24/7, or book a tow truck service through the app.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Contact Details -->
        <div class="contact">
            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have any further questions, feel free to reach out to us:</p>
            <p>Email: FuelPro@vehiclecenter.com</p>
            <p>Phone: 0714563522</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
